WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:16.638
"Let go of me!" yelled Roxy.

2
00:00:16.639 --> 00:00:20.115
Four Professor Dittos dragged her down a hallway.

3
00:00:20.116 --> 00:00:25.554
Roxy kicked and squirmed.

4
00:00:25.555 --> 00:00:28.463
The professors pushed her into a dark room.

5
00:00:28.464 --> 00:00:33.858
Roxy heard a heavy door slam behind her.

6
00:00:33.859 --> 00:00:37.541
"Aargh!" Roxy stamped her foot.

7
00:00:37.542 --> 00:00:39.363
The walls shook.

8
00:00:39.364 --> 00:00:42.072
"Rocket Girl!" said a familiar voice.

9
00:00:42.073 --> 00:00:44.120
"What are you doing here?"

10
00:00:44.121 --> 00:00:46.512
Roxy peered into the darkness.

11
00:00:46.513 --> 00:00:50.593
"Mayor Bloom?" she said.

12
00:00:50.594 --> 00:00:52.895
"I came here to find you.

13
00:00:52.896 --> 00:00:57.615
Your assistant said you stole the playground money this morning."

14
00:00:57.616 --> 00:00:59.562
Mayor Bloom frowned.

15
00:00:59.563 --> 00:01:01.726
"I didn't steal any money.

16
00:01:01.727 --> 00:01:04.974
I never even got to City Hall this morning.

17
00:01:04.975 --> 00:01:07.958
I was kidnapped and brought here."

18
00:01:07.959 --> 00:01:09.889
Roxy was confused.

19
00:01:09.890 --> 00:01:12.833
"But your assistant saw you . . ."

20
00:01:12.834 --> 00:01:15.516
The mayor sighed.

21
00:01:15.517 --> 00:01:19.055
"She saw something that looked like me," he said.

22
00:01:19.056 --> 00:01:22.380
"Professor Ditto made a robot clone of me.

23
00:01:22.381 --> 00:01:24.512
And now I know why.

24
00:01:24.513 --> 00:01:27.967
He wanted my clone to steal that money!"

25
00:01:27.968 --> 00:01:33.968
Roxy gulped. "I think we have a bigger problem than stolen money, Mayor."

26
00:01:33.969 --> 00:01:37.043
"What do you mean?" asked Mayor Bloom.

27
00:01:37.044 --> 00:01:41.784
"Professor Ditto made a robot clone of me!" said Roxy.

28
00:01:41.785 --> 00:01:44.783
"Who knows what it will do?"

29
00:01:44.784 --> 00:01:47.471
"Oh no!" said Mayor Bloom.

30
00:01:47.472 --> 00:01:50.523
"It will have all of your super powers!

31
00:01:50.524 --> 00:01:52.808
You have to stop it!"

32
00:01:52.809 --> 00:01:56.634
Roxy nodded. "Step back, Mayor.

33
00:01:56.635 --> 00:02:02.025
I'm going to blast us out of here."

34
00:02:02.026 --> 00:02:05.877
Detective Smith was speeding toward Metro City University.

35
00:02:05.878 --> 00:02:08.659
A call came in on his radio.

36
00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:11.431
"Detective," said the police dispatcher.

37
00:02:11.432 --> 00:02:15.839
"The Metro City Museum is being robbed!"

38
00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:19.736
"I'll be there as soon as I can," said Detective Smith.

39
00:02:19.737 --> 00:02:22.519
"First I have to catch up with Rocket Girl.

40
00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:26.503
She went to Metro City University to find Mayor Bloom."

41
00:02:26.504 --> 00:02:29.254
"No, she didn't," said the dispatcher.

42
00:02:29.255 --> 00:02:31.935
"Rocket Girl is at the museum."

43
00:02:31.936 --> 00:02:34.803
"She is?" asked Detective Smith.

44
00:02:34.804 --> 00:02:36.904
"What is she doing there?"

45
00:02:36.905 --> 00:02:40.651
"You're not going to believe this," said the dispatcher.

46
00:02:40.652 --> 00:02:45.482
"But Rocket Girl is the one robbing the museum!"

47
00:02:45.483 --> 00:02:48.186
Detective Smith scratched his head.

48
00:02:48.187 --> 00:02:52.827
"What is going on today?"

49
00:02:52.828 --> 00:02:57.393
A minute later Detective Smith arrived at the museum.

50
00:02:57.394 --> 00:03:01.668
The Rocket Girl robot clone was carrying a priceless vase.

51
00:03:01.669 --> 00:03:03.892
Detective Smith was stunned.

52
00:03:03.893 --> 00:03:06.316
"Rocket Girl!" he cried.

53
00:03:06.317 --> 00:03:09.739
"What are you doing?"

54
00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:14.100
Whiz-hoo! Lasers shot from the clone's eyes.

55
00:03:14.101 --> 00:03:15.878
Detective Smith ducked.

56
00:03:15.879 --> 00:03:20.393
Just then the real Roxy landed in front of the detective.

57
00:03:20.394 --> 00:03:23.869
The lasers bounced off her chest.

58
00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:26.181
Detective Smith looked at Roxy.

59
00:03:26.182 --> 00:03:28.913
He looked at the Rocket Girl robot clone.

60
00:03:28.914 --> 00:03:31.569
Detective Smith rubbed his eyes.

61
00:03:31.570 --> 00:03:37.988
"Two Rocket Girls?"
